        "id": 1065256
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-16T08:50:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did take a look at this option, but the issue here is the `commit()` method that is different between both implementations (if a cache is being used, we need to evict the entry after commit). Wrapping instead of inheritance is thus not straight forward.",
      "parentUuid": "1ce10d94_c7f005d4",
      "revId": "9684c6f8c386a7e85c82b5d1ffc87719d2980367",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9d44ea66_8eebc726",
