        "id": 1003873
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-16T12:41:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why would it be not straightforward with wrapping:\n```\npublic void commit() {\n  this.wrapped.commit();\n  cache.invalidate();\n}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "8af4ddfb_d6ecaabb",
      "revId": "9684c6f8c386a7e85c82b5d1ffc87719d2980367",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
